     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §20, Town L",
    "lawSection": "Town Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S7083\n\nSPONSOR: HINCHEY\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the town law, in relation to authorizing the increase of\nthe number of town justices in the town of Rotterdam, Schenectady county\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis legislation would allow the town of Rotterdam to increase the\nnumber of town justices from two to three.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 amends subdivision 1 of section 20 of the town law to allow\nthe town of Rotterdam to increase the number of justices they currently\nhave\n\nSection 2 provides the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:  The town of Rotterdam has expressed the need for a\nthird town justice position to handle the volume court cases within the\ntown.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew Bill\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
