    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S7083A\n\nSPONSOR: HINCHEY\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the town law, in relation to authorizing the increase of\nthe number of town justices in the town of Rotterdam, Schenectady county\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis legislation would allow the town of Rotterdam to increase the\nnumber of town justices from two to three.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 amends subdivision 1 of section 20 of the town law to allow\nthe town of Rotterdam to increase the number of justices they currently\nhave\n\nSection 2 provides the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe town of Rotterdam has expressed the need for a third town justice\nposition to handle the volume court cases within the town.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew Bill\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
